OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther      
OL,6,Fshowers affecting Cornwall this        
OL,7,Fevening, although these will gradually 
OL,8,Fease overnight. Staying largely dry    
OL,9,Fwith lengthy clear spells elsewhere,   
OL,10,Fwith a fairly widespread frost         
OL,11,Fdeveloping, especially away from       
OL,12,Fcoastal districts. Chance of isolated  
OL,13,Ffreezing fog patches by dawn.          
OL,15,CSaturday:FFrost and fog patches clear  
OL,16,Fleaving a dry day with sunny spells,   
OL,17,Fbut heavy rain and gusty winds arrive  
OL,18,Fin the southwest by the evening.       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
