OL,3,GSouth West                             
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday  
OL,6,Fwill be wet, with rain clearing the    
OL,7,Ffar southwest later. Monday begins     
OL,8,Fdry, but heavy showers arrive later    
OL,9,Fwith persistent rain on Tuesday. Winds 
OL,10,Fwill be gusty throughout.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
